# Lumen OS images of every model (image path /system/etc/init/z9x_blobs.rc; the one blobs reader
# /system/etc/z9x/z9x_blobs.sh 0755, its settings /system/etc/z9x/blobs.conf and the allow-list they name 0644, plus
# the 0-byte placeholders listed there, label system_lib_file for a .so). See z9x_blobs.sh.
# exec at post-fs-data: after init.rc's part of the trigger (default mount namespace, APEXes active), so the binds over
# the vendor and VNDK APEX files are seen by every later service; the Codec2 / media services, audioserver, the vendor
# audio HAL and (X50 family) the eye-protection drawer start only after it returns ('on boot' and later).
# Cost: well under a second, at most the tmpfs of blobs.conf while it runs.
on post-fs-data
    exec u:r:su:s0 root root -- /system/bin/sh /system/etc/z9x/z9x_blobs.sh
